THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS

This repository vendors three third-party front-end libraries under
`app/static/vendor/`. They are NOT covered by the licence above; each keeps its
own, and each ships its full licence text alongside it:

  * KaTeX 0.16.11        MIT     app/static/vendor/katex/LICENSE
  * htmx 2.0.4           BSD-2   app/static/vendor/htmx.LICENSE
  * fft.js 4.0.4         MIT     app/static/vendor/fftjs/LICENSE

fft.js is vendored with exactly one line changed (`module.exports = FFT;` to
`export default FFT;`, because browsers have no `module` identifier). The
change and the upstream SHA-256 are recorded in the file header, and a test
(`tests/test_demos.py`) checks the rest of the file byte for byte.

The six built-in audio samples under `app/static/demos/samples/` are generated
by `scripts/make_demo_samples.py` and are covered by the licence above. One of
them (`speech-welcome.wav`) was synthesised with eSpeak NG; the synthesiser is
not distributed here, only its output.
